openim-vue-web-demo

This project is a community Vue 3 + Vite web-only migration of:

  openimsdk/openim-electron-demo
  https://github.com/openimsdk/openim-electron-demo

The migration baseline is openim-electron-demo v3.8.3.

The original project, OpenIM SDKs, OpenIM Server ecosystem, names, and
related trademarks belong to their respective owners.

This repository is not an official OpenIM Vue project. It is maintained
as a community migration for developers who want a Vue Web reference
implementation while preserving the original Web API and WASM SDK call
flows where migrated.

